recommend keep-going -- sixteen unrostered front doors stand above the Door ceiling; press/README.md at 27 percent with 9 living citers is the next crux by the same two measurements the counsel sweep used
scope one front door recovered, swept and rostered; two logs recovered with their rows; two roster counts derived; no module, wire, or store touched
